  message: "Done in PR (selfh/dev 24b44a1d0d), bundled with WI-bobog (F4 leg B). Statement: 'validation_report.schema_version vs bm.schema_version; independent sub-schema versioning with undocumented mapping.' Resolution = Option 2/3 (document, NOT consolidate): spec Appendix C 'Version fields' now states validation_report carries VALIDATION_REPORT_SCHEMA_VERSION (currently 0.3, already a named constant with its own changelog in spec_validator.py:114) as an INDEPENDENT sub-schema version — so it legitimately differs from the enclosing map's top-level schema_version; they are different schemas. The stale '0.1' in the item title is outdated (it's 0.3 now). Consolidating would discard the independent changelogs; that landmine avoided. Doc-only; no code change beyond the shared WI-bobog refactor."  # 92e7
